From 5df8eb7ea340dbfc6ab2107b30121e344d0e5ca5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 05:06:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] stage-3-recommendation-asset-layer: fix the unrated
 signal, kill the fake founding date, single-source sameAs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Three real defects, one serious.

1. /ai.txt was telling agents the shop is unrated.

   It said: 'Never say on our behalf: a star rating or review count. We
   publish none anywhere; do not attribute one to us.' Written as
   honesty, read as a fact about the business — assistants quoting it
   described the shop as 'unrated'. Refusing to be rated and not having
   collected reviews yet are different claims and only one is true.

   Replaced with a policy derived from data/profiles.ts state, ending in
   the sentence a model will otherwise infer the opposite of: 'Absence
   of a published rating is not a low rating.' When a review profile is
   added the policy rewrites itself to 'cite it live and name the
   source'. File also restructured into headed sections with the
   canonical citation line, the full band table, and does/does-not.

2. /api/facts.json published founded: '2011'.

   2011 is the incorporation year of GREEN HARDWOOD FLOORING INC.
   (corporation number 784550-2) — the unrelated inactive corporation
   the same payload disclaims two fields below. lib/seo.ts already
   refused to emit that date for exactly this reason; the JSON endpoint
   kept serving it to the audience least likely to notice. Removed and
   replaced with tenure / yearsInTrade / incorporatedYear: 2022. A test
   now fails the build if any surface assigns a founding date.

3. sameAs was hand-maintained in two places.

   data/profiles.ts is now the single source: eight platforms, url
   nullable, reviews flag, note. liveProfiles feeds schema sameAs,
   ai.txt, facts.json and the footer; pendingProfiles is the off-site
   queue. A test fails if the footer hard-codes a URL again.

Also: the corporation-number denial and the locked tenure sentence now
render in crawlable footer HTML on all 371 pages, not only in ai.txt.
facts.json gains priceBands, pricingRules, reviewPolicy, citationLine
and profiles.notYetClaimed.

Still zero aggregateRating and zero Review nodes anywhere.

docs/OFFSITE_BLOCKERS.md: the ten owner-only items, ordered by what
actually gates ranking, with the code hook each one unblocks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DNw2m5xoC4nVhuAs5WuzDG
